<title>USA: Newsweb Corp files suit in Chicago Dock bid.</title>
<headline>Newsweb Corp files suit in Chicago Dock bid.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newsweb Corp and its CDCT Acquisition Trust unit have filed a lawsuit to protect its $21 a share agreement to acquire real estate investment trust Chicago Dock &amp; Canal Trust, according to a filing Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The lawsuit filed Friday against  MCL Construction Corp and its affiliate  Cityfront Center LLC alleges tortious interference by Cityfront with the agreement between Newsweb and Chicago Dock.</p>
<p>Cityfront made an unsolicited $22 a share offer for Chicago Dock in November, which was raised to $23 a share, Chicago Dock said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chicago Dock shares closed up 15/16 at 22-3/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
